[{"client_msg_id":"a470dbb7-9e31-434a-b769-f8c4fd7dfc9a","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"BufEnter ++once で doautocmd FileType するとかか…","ts":"1632115806.042400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E8RRC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f5feb2a-2a60-48c3-be67-30b7f6d8c2dd","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"表示時に改めて FileType が効くような動きができると一番いいのかな…","ts":"1632115768.041500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dD1F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ef1fa8e-3cd2-4f78-9dac-b3261cef4cda","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"syntax を自前で当ててるので、FileType イベントは無視可能。（たぶん…）","ts":"1632115722.040600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N+VDU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"caa3c45a-b877-4c09-a607-e7c1b99ad726","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ただし、今回のケースではそれでいいかもしれません、","ts":"1632115692.039700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LnAV7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"868a21c8-e0f5-4816-a2d6-fbefa471e1cd","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"その場合、FileType イベントが発火されるがスルーされるので、一般的な解決にはならないかもです。（syntax が表示時に効かなくなる）","ts":"1632115677.039200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gVYB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82defb05-4c39-47cd-9e50-e7679fc437a4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"普通のファイルでやると(イベントが起きないので) filetype が適用されなかったりとか色々問題あった気がするんですけど、専用の無名バッファならそんなに問題なさそうな予感も?","ts":"1632115634.037800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wMtGB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"408e0adc-d946-4fa0-ab20-2f6b99ec40f3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Vim の場合はどうするのがいいんだろう… noautocmd + `bufload()` だと何かまずかったりしましたっけ","ts":"1632115583.036600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bHQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"439eeed3-246b-4732-8c4c-0686195d523f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"bufload にはそこそこ煮え湯を飲まされているので、やめられるならやめたい感が…","ts":"1632115534.036100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XMUl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48b43612-96cb-4edd-b0b8-f4bdb11d6a4b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"neovim にはスクラッチバッファなる概念があるらしく、非表示かつ未ロードの状態で書込み可能なバッファが作れるっぽいですが、vim の場合のやり方がわからないんですよね。","ts":"1632115496.035100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AC0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba5752aa-d5e7-4003-a214-d92f88df7d3a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"たしか `bufload()` すると切り替わるイベントが発生したはず","ts":"1632115432.033400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+zXr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ad23938-fdcd-4eb0-85af-87c8ed4c7c57","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"で、おそらくですが bufload すると一瞬バッファが切り替わってるのかな…と想像してます（vital-vs 側で切り替えてる可能性もありますが）","ts":"1632115390.032900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B58"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bf76dfe-30da-4534-9ca5-d043c1c313cc","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"無名バッファを作ったあと「一度実際に表示してみる」or「bufload で loaded 状態にする」をしないと、setbufline などができないからです。","ts":"1632115331.031200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JSRZ9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7ae85bd-8b8b-4a42-b191-aa5d15e4d05f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"バッファの中身を書き込んでから popup-win などで表示させる。という手順のコードになってますが","ts":"1632115265.029400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sxT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8875d885-0e68-469b-9dc6-3d4b7d32e48d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"bufload はなんで必要なんでしたっけ","ts":"1632115181.027500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1rV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34c5fb61-c8d6-4325-8d5e-7bff6a987a7c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"bufload のせいなんだろうな…どうしたらいいのか…","ts":"1632115079.027200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vkaq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b42e34f-56af-4cba-90fe-e4333ff9b883","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`call lsp#disable()` してからだと再現しないので vim-lsp 関連であることは間違いなさそう","ts":"1632114851.025900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7cTQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3557483b-a4ac-41ed-8fa5-c5d7639a609b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":bow:","ts":"1632114743.025400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FR9H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"794ef95d-cb8e-475f-b505-fef3dab34f6b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"となると、補完ウィンドウということですね…。今度倒しに行きます。","ts":"1632114730.025200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XXY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8acb75ce-9fbc-4184-bd10-97b0286f5f53","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"挿入モードで 1 文字入力しただけでも変わっちゃうな…","ts":"1632114615.024100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aeIL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c2348c5-6570-46b6-aa18-d2200c91bf75","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"たぶん、補完が出る時…?","ts":"1632114541.023700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DOe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3da9b39-a7cd-4d6e-bdec-449c73be8b39","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あれ、それまだ駄目なのでしたっけ。その認識がなかったです。来週の連休なら見れるかもなので再現手順教えていただければ。"